rious inconsistency)"},  {"cell_id":15,"text":"Esmolol probably reduced 28-d mortality in patients with sepsis"},  {"cell_id":16,"text":"Landiolol vs. SOC"},  {"cell_id":17,"text":"RR, 1.09 (0.79–1.50); 471 patients in three RCTs"},  {"cell_id":19,"text":"545/1000 (395–750)"},  {"cell_id":20,"text":"45 more per 1000 (95% CI, 105 fewer to 250 more)"},  {"cell_id":21,"text":"Low (serious inconsistency, serious imprecision)"},  {"cell_id":22,"text":"Landiolol may not reduce 28-d mortality in patients with sepsis"},  {"cell_id":23,"text":"Landiolol vs. esmolol (indirect)"},  {"cell_id":24,"text":"RR, 1.57 (1.08–2.30); 0 RCT"},  {"cell_id":25,"text":"Not estimated"},  {"cell_id":26,"text":"Low (serious intransitivity)"},  {"cell_id":27,"text":"Esmolol may reduce 28-d mortality in patients with sepsis compared with landiolol"},  {"cell_id":28,"text":"ICU length of stay (975 patients in nine RCTs)"},  {"cell_id":29,"text":"Esmolol vs. SOC"},  {"cell_id":30,"text":"MD, –1.29 (–3.88 to 1.31); 502 patients in six RCTs"},  {"cell_id":33,"text":"1.29 lower (95% CI, 3.88 lower to 1.31 higher)"},  {"cell_id":34,"text":"Very low (serious methodological limitations, very serious inconsistency, serious imprecision)"},  {"cell_id":35,"text":"The evidence is uncertain about the effect of esmolol on ICU length of stay"},  {"cell_id":36,"text":"Landiolol vs. SOC"},  {"cell_id":37,"text":"MD, –0.74 (–5.39 to 3.92); 437 patients in three RCTs"},  {"cell_id":40,"text":"0.74 lower (95% CI, 5.39 lower to 3.92 higher)"},  {"cell_id":41,"text":"Very low (serious methodological limitations, serious inconsistency, serious imprecision)"},  {"cell_id":42,"text":"The evidence is uncertain about the effect of landiolol on ICU length of stay"},  {"cell_id":43,"text":"Landiolol vs. esmolol (indirect)"},  {"cell_id":44,"text":"MD, 0.55 (–4.77 to 5.87); 0 RCT"},  {"cell_id":45,"text":"Not estimated"},  {"cell_id":46,"text":"0.55 higher (95% CI, 4.77 lower to 5.87 higher)"},  {"cell_id":47,"text":"Very low (serious intransitivity, serious imprecision)"},  {"cell_id":48,"text":"The evidence is uncertain about the effect of esmolol vs. landiolol on ICU length of stay"} ]}
